   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FSP-Invasive Alien Species-UNDP-CHN-00100197</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chinas agrobiodiversity faces threats from invasive alien species (IAS) that impact agroecosystems and biodiversity, including traditional varieties and genetic resources for food and agriculture (GRFA). To address this, the project aims to strengthen the protection of agrobiodiversity through reducing threats and integrating IAS prevention, control, and management into government planning. The project will focus on strengthening the enabling environment, enhancing IAS management frameworks and</narrative>
  </description>
